  Copyright (c) 2018 RuoYi
  Licensed under the MIT License. The full text is kept at
  frontend/LICENSE and must be retained in redistributed copies.

  Retained unused scaffold: the menus seeded by Flyway V2 point only at
  the BALANCLOUD pages under frontend/src/views/balan/, so some upstream
  RuoYi pages (frontend/src/views/monitor/, frontend/src/views/tool/ and
