Mini program (miniapp/)

  Original uni-app work. Third-party npm dependencies (Vue 3, uni-app
  runtime, Pinia) keep their own licenses as declared in their packages.

Backend service (backend/)

  Written from scratch for BALANCLOUD on top of Spring Boot 3,
  Spring Security 6, MyBatis-Plus, Eclipse Paho MQTT client and
  Apache POI. The HTTP contracts `/login`, `/getInfo`, `/getRouters`,
  `/logout` and `/captchaImage` follow the RuoYi-Vue3 frontend
  specification so that the scaffold can be used unchanged; no RuoYi
  Boot 2 source code is included.

Database and deployment (deploy/, backend/**/db/migration/)

  Schema and migration scripts (core Flyway V1–V30) are original work. Middleware images referenced by
  docker-compose (MySQL, Redis, EMQX, TDengine) are separate third-party
  products under their own licenses and are not distributed with this
  repository.

Charging-pile protocol references

  The platform speaks an original MQTT protocol ("BalanCloud Device
  Protocol v1") specified in docs/PROTOCOL-SDK.md. Cloud Charge (云快充)
  and vendor socket specifications were consulted only as functional
  references; no protocol documents, images, wording or scripts from
  any third-party charging platform — including AGPL/XCPL-licensed
  projects — were copied into this repository.
